        "verse": 15
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "DEU",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 15
        }
      ],
      "en": "for the LORD your God among you is a jealous God, lest the anger of the LORD your God be kindled against you, and he destroy you from off the face of the earth.",
      "ko": "너희 중에 계신 너희 하나님 여호와는 질투하시는 하나님이신즉 너희 하나님 여호와께서 네게 진노하사 너를 지면에서 멸절시키실까 두려워하노라",
      "source_text_hash": "88b1aa0f5f1537cba8ac9068781d632a1902c89ec4e557b8ac4d1b6fb3c92ccb",
      "translation_text_hash": "c6d6e904a945ef81d5afaedd58949c9e5e7680fc5e0b0faae20214d9a3b4f023",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
