      "en": "You shall diligently keep the commandments of the LORD your God, and his testimonies, and his statutes, which he has commanded you.",
      "ko": "너희의 하나님 여호와께서 너희에게 명하신 명령과 증거하신 것과 규례를 삼가 지키며",
      "source_text_hash": "f1af60e839722ed514843c4972e45f46268372543f1d01b35b15fd173f5b7c95",
      "translation_text_hash": "d113e38be53fdb6a347e91e07b4c4cc82774b4a87e345691409693ff7e2ed309",
