      "en": "and he brought us out from there, that he might bring us in, to give us the land which he swore to our fathers.",
      "ko": "우리 열조에게 맹세하신 땅으로 우리에게 주어 들어가게 하시려고 우리를 거기서 인도하여 내시고",
      "source_text_hash": "0488c2e0640cf9cd2cf63582509788725212f53981917cd52d0ab165ed27c470",
      "translation_text_hash": "e1f7e55e4620c896ad77c2581919242a3c1ef1500ac4413aae83db945a4d2148",
